207-,,0,0,0,,Çabuk, Vivi-chan.Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.33,0:01:58.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bana ne olduğunu anlat.Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.97,0:02:02.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san, ama az önce vurulmadın mı?Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.31,0:02:03.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hım?Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.51,0:02:04.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben mi?Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.97,0:02:11.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Alo?Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.57,0:02:13.07,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Onun icabına baktık.Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.07,0:02:15.84,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu tuhaf herifle ne yapalım?!Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.84,0:02:18.20,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Neredesiniz? Yerinizi bildirin!Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.20,0:02:24.66,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam... Rainbase'deki Rain Dinners kumarhanesinin ön kapısındayız.Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.66,0:02:28.75,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam, iyi iş. Mükemmel performans.Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.75,0:02:30.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi patronun gelecek.Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.83,0:02:35.84,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,T-Teşekkür ederim. Şimdi gidebilir miyim?Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.30,0:02:37.47,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayır, bayım.Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.51,0:02:43.22,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben de öyle düşünmüştüm...Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.22,0:02:44.72,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Bak, Chopper.Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.72,0:02:48.52,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Dostları, demin ortalığı dağıttığımız yerde toplanmaya başladı.Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.15,0:02:53.31,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen de kimsin lan?Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.31,0:02:55.94,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,B-Benim adım, Bay Prens.Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.94,0:03:01.45,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha? Yani bütün bunların sorumlusu sen miydin?Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.08,0:03:03.60,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,N-Nihayet yardım ediyorum...Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.41,0:03:08.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Beni adım, Bay Prens!Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.75,0:03:17.92,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Beni adım, Bay Prens!Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.10,0:03:26.51,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Burada ne oldu böyle?Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.56,0:03:35.44,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,K-Kendine "Bay Prens" diyen adam...Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.94,0:03:40.99,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,O...Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.67,0:03:56.50,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Felaket! Köprü yıkıldı!Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.01,0:04:07.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aşağı yukarı böyle oldu işte.Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.93,0:04:11.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tony-kun iyi olacak mı?Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.52,0:04:11.06,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Olacak.Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.06,0:04:14.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sonuçta birkaç küçük numarası var.Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.65,0:04:24.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Piç herif... Nerede saklanıyorsun, Bay Prens?Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.12,0:04:29.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni bulup geberteceğim!Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.04,0:04:33.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Aman dikkat… Kalbim küt küt…Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.17,0:04:39.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Öleceğiz! Öleceğiz! – Su! Su!Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.34,0:04:44.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kafes dolarsa, işimiz bitti demektir!!Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.01,0:04:48.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, seni aptal timsah! Bana en iyi vuruşunu yap!Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.68,0:04:49.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyorsun, Nami?!Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.68,0:04:56.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu kışkırtıyorum ki kafesi paramparça etsin!Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anladım! İyi fikir!Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.11,0:05:02.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gel bakalım, seni aptal muz! Seni çürümüş muz!Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.53,0:05:06.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayır, yanlış anladın! O özünde bir timsah.Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.82,0:05:08.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kafasında da muz çıkıyor.Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.32,0:05:10.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öf be...? Yine mi?Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.28,0:05:13.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Örneğin, şu maymun dansı var ya?Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.00,0:05:14.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni çürümüş muz!Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.83,0:05:16.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dediğimi dinle!Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.46,0:05:17.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.46,0:05:20.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Örneğin, şu maymun dansı var ya?Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.34,0:05:23.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maymun bir hayvan ama maymun dansı bir dans ve…Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.76,0:05:27.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ona dokunma! Dikkatini ver!Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.01,0:05:29.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Timsahlar ve muzlar yenebilir şeyler değil mi?Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.26,0:05:30.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geliyor!Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.81,0:05:39.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşe yaramadı!Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.15,0:05:42.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu kafesin nesi var?!Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.11,0:05:44.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi, lütfen acele et!Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.24,0:05:45.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, siz.Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.99,0:05:46.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hah?Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.53,0:05:49.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nasıl bu kadar sakin kalabiliyorsun?!Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.70,0:05:52.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen de bir şeyler düşün!Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.29,0:05:58.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile'ın amaçlarının ne kadarını biliyorsunuz?Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.92,0:06:01.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile'ın yanındaki kadın,Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.84,0:06:06.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,20 yıldır Dünya Hükûmeti tarafından aranıyor.Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.01,0:06:08.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanırım başındaki ödül 70 milyondu.Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.38,0:06:10.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N...?! 70 milyon mu?!Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.93,0:06:13.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-Ne olmuş?Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.14,0:06:15.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile'inkine eşdeğer bu…Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.56,0:06:18.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O ikisinin güçlerini birleştirmesiyle,Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.14,0:06:20.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bu artık sıradan bir darbe olmaktan çıktı.Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.81,0:06:21.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Durdurulmazlarsa,Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.81,0:06:25.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bu tüm dünyayı yutan bir fekakete dönüşecek.Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.99,0:06:29.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tüm dünyayı mı? Ne demek istiyorsun?Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.11,0:06:31.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fazla ciddiye almadın mı?Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.57,0:06:34.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neden bahsediyorsun?Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.45,0:06:34.08,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Hah?Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.08,0:06:37.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burada tek amacım onun işini bitirmek! Gerisi boş!Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.79,0:06:42.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum...Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.21,0:06:46.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse buradan nasıl çıkacaksın?Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.63,0:06:49.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uyluğuma kadar gelmiş!Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.68,0:06:53.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öleceğiz! Öleceğiz! Hayır!Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.26,0:06:56.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Daha fazla dayanamıyorum...Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.47,0:07:01.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eyvah! Bu çok kötü! Dayan! Vivi böyle demişti, değil mi?!Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.02,0:07:04.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi, bu senin için zor olmalı.Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.69,0:07:06.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zamanın olmadığını da biliyorum…Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.53,0:07:09.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin.Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.74,0:07:12.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Daha iyi bir kılıç ustası olsaydım, bu kafes önemsiz olurdu!Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.74,0:07:17.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sofrada kükremek hiç kibar bir davranış değil.Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.30,0:07:19.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.96,0:07:29.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Görgüsüz Tekme Servisi!Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.79,0:07:59.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Selam.Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.62,0:08:01.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok beklettim mi?Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.21,0:08:04.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Ahhh! Prens! – Ahhh! Prens!Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.33,0:08:05.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şükürler olsun.Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.63,0:08:08.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalga geçmeyi bırak ve hemen anahtarı bul!Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.50,0:08:10.30,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san!Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.30,0:08:13.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-Beni seviyor musun?!Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.63,0:08:17.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet, evet. Seviyorum. Şimdi aç şu kapıyı!Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.47,0:08:18.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam!Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.97,0:08:21.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aptallığının sınırı yok ha?Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.54,0:08:21.27,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Mellorine! Mellorine!Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.27,0:08:25.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi! Aferin!Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.36,0:08:27.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.82,0:08:32.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Birbiri ardına geliyorlar.Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.90,0:08:37.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hadi Sanji! Hakla onları!Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.29,0:08:41.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İstediğiniz kadar...Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.95,0:08:44.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bir araya gelip saldırın, sizi lanet muzlar!Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.46,0:08:47.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir bayana saldıracak kadar kaba olan her pisliğin,Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.92,0:08:51.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,sofra terbiyesine ihtiyacı var demektir.Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.92,0:08:53.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Hiç zaman yok!Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.88,0:08:57.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onları bir saniyede hallet! Hayır, bir anda!Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.05,0:09:00.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Odaya giren üçüncüyü hallet.Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.81,0:09:03.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne? Nasıl bilebilirsin?Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.48,0:09:05.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Siz sersemler sağır mısınız?Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.73,0:09:08.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hırlaması, anahtarı yutanla aynı.Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.61,0:09:12.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Biraz zaman kazanmak için köprüyü yıktı.Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.94,0:09:16.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yakalanmayan bir kaç arkadaşları daha olmalı.Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.28,0:09:19.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Amaçları bizi şaşırtıp odaya ulaşmak mıydı?Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.78,0:09:21.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Büyük ihtimalle.Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.33,0:09:23.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte!Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.21,0:09:30.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kafesin anahtarı!Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.51,0:09:33.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O da ne öyle?Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.71,0:09:36.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anahtar gibi görünmüyor!Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.01,0:09:38.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mum-Mum Topu...Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.39,0:09:41.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Açıl!Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.22,0:09:41.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah!Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.93,0:09:43.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.22,0:09:48.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! S-Su! Her taraf su! Bu bir mucize!Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.56,0:09:50.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, bu o!Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.86,0:09:52.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,3! Bu 3!Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.69,0:09:57.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bay 3! Timsahın midesinde ne işin vardı?!Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.74,0:10:04.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayattayım! Öleceğimi sanmıştım!Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.62,0:10:09.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile, benden kurtulmak niyetindeysen daha iyisini yapmalısın.Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.42,0:10:12.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yutulduğum anda,Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.67,0:10:17.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,son gücümle bu Mum-Mum topunu yarattım!Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.89,0:10:22.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu da ne?Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.93,0:10:25.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anahtarı bize ver!Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.89,0:10:28.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! Siz!Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.31,0:10:32.73,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne? Bu anahtar mı?Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.23,0:10:34.61,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Bekle.Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.36,0:10:38.20,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Sürekli su dolan bir oda.Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.20,0:10:44.16,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Çelik bir kafes... ve bir anahtar.Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.29,0:10:48.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Durumu anladım.Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.62,0:10:50.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Demek sen, Bay 3'sün?Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.59,0:10:55.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ödümü kopardın.Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.92,0:10:59.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen Bay 3'müsün? Sorun çıkarmadan anahtarı ver.Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.76,0:11:03.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Daha iyi bir fikrim var...Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.43,0:11:07.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uzun bir atışa ne dersiniz?!Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.43,0:11:08.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.61,0:11:19.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kim olduğunu bilmiyorum ama onlardan biri gibi görünüyorsun.Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.49,0:11:21.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anahtarı istiyorsan, gidip ara!Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.57,0:11:26.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ancak, bulamazsan sorumlusu ben değilim!Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.87,0:11:28.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pislik...Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.91,0:11:33.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya bu kişi, anahtarı yutan timsahı bulursa?Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.79,0:11:35.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pek bir önemi yok.Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.54,0:11:38.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doğru timsahı bulsalar bile,Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.21,0:11:44.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,gerçek anahtar bende. İstedikleri kadar mücadele etsinler.Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.93,0:11:46.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok kötüsün.Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.85,0:11:48.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dur biraz, Sanji!Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.93,0:11:52.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mum-Mum yeteneğini kullanarak bu kafes için bir anahtar yapamaz mı?Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.82,0:11:59.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doğru.Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.79,0:12:09.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aferin, mum adam.Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.13,0:12:21.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Acele edelim. Zamanımız yok.Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.22,0:12:26.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet. Eminim kullandıkları yol Alubarna'ya çıkıyordur.Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.72,0:12:29.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama geçitte hâlâ bir sürü Muz Timsahı var!Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.39,0:12:36.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Başka yok mu?! Bu yetmez!Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.82,0:12:39.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Endişelenecek bir şey yok...Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.28,0:12:42.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir tanesiyle bile başa çıkamadım!Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.70,0:12:46.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,H-Hayır! Onlar normal değil, sakın alınma!Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.70,0:12:50.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lanet olsun, ıslakken o kadar güçlü değilim!Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.51,0:13:06.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Duvarlar yıkılıyor!Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.59,0:13:08.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aptal, aşırıya kaçtın!Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.76,0:13:11.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geçit bile parçalandı!Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.68,0:13:14.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gitme vakti! Buradan çıkalım!Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.53,0:13:28.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu sinir bozucu küçük balıklara yeterince katlandım.Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.78,0:13:32.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşlerini kendim bitirme vakti.Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.50,0:13:39.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu da ne?Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.35,0:13:59.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, yaşıyor musun, Luffy?Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.40,0:14:04.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp-san, kalk!Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.69,0:14:09.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üff, ne halt ediyorsun?! Yapman gerektiği gibi yüzsene!Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.07,0:14:14.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şeytan meyvesi yemiş olanlar kesinlikle berbat bir zayıflığa sahipler.Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.21,0:14:19.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oha, Smoker!Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.96,0:14:23.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey hey, Zoro, Niye düşmanı kurtardın?!Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.50,0:14:28.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kapa' çeneni! İstediğimden değil. Kendi hâline bırakmak daha iyi olurdu.Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.47,0:14:32.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neyse. Gidelim artık!Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.93,0:14:36.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok zaman kaybettik. Vivi-chan, hâlâ başarabilir miyiz?Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.43,0:14:37.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bilmiyorum.Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.48,0:14:38.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san...Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.69,0:14:41.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nanohana'da aldığın parfüm sende mi?Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.77,0:14:44.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eh? Evet, niye?Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.40,0:14:46.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üzerine sık.Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.49,0:14:48.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Böyle mi?Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.65,0:14:51.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Bir kez daha aşık oluyorum!Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.74,0:14:54.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bırak şakayı ve harekete geç!Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.70,0:14:56.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Roronoa!Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.83,0:14:59.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Niye beni kurtardın?Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.73,0:15:26.11,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro! Onu kurtar!Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.11,0:15:29.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hah?! O düşmanımız! Boş ver onu!Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.74,0:15:33.24,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama onu bırakırsak, ölecek!Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.32,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yüzemiyor!Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.32,0:15:37.45,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayır, şey... bunu biliyorum!Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.45,0:15:39.25,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama o...!!Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.42,0:15:44.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaptanım ne dediyse onu yaptım.Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.54,0:15:47.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bana teşekkür etmeyi düşünme.Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.75,0:15:50.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anlık bir kapristi. Kafana takma.Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.80,0:15:57.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse görevimi yerine getirmemden rahatsız olmazsınız ha?Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.39,0:16:02.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gördün mü? Demedim mi sana? Bir denizciyi kurtarmanın cezası bu.Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.15,0:16:10.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka Korsanları'nı buldunuz mu?Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.40,0:16:13.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet ve Albay Smoker da yanlarında!Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.70,0:16:16.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ona destek olacağız!Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.24,0:16:23.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam, beyler! Doğruca Alubarna'ya gidiyoruz!Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.17,0:16:25.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile nerede?!Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.63,0:16:29.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, sonunda uyandılar.Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.30,0:16:37.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dumanlı! Dövüşmek mi istiyorsun?!Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.51,0:16:39.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Smoker!Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.52,0:16:42.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Luffy! Bunu yapma! Kaçalım!Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.10,0:16:45.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu çocuk ciddi mi?Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.69,0:16:53.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu taraftan! Acele edin!Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.33,0:17:03.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gidin.Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.75,0:17:09.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sadece bu seferlik gitmenize izin vereceğim.Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.67,0:17:12.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir dahaki karşılaşmamızda öleceksin.Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.73,0:17:25.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oradalar!Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.03,0:17:36.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaçmalarına izin vermeyin!Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.82,0:17:39.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hadi gidelim. Denizciler geliyor.Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.74,0:17:41.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alubarna ne tarafta?Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.79,0:17:44.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O tarafta! Doğruca doğuya!Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.21,0:17:49.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, acele et! Ne yapıyorsun?Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.54,0:17:51.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam...Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.89,0:18:01.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu kez kaçamayacaklar!Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.02,0:18:06.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sevilmeyecek biri değilsin, biliyor musun?Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.69,0:18:17.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hemen buradan defol!!Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.34,0:18:33.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sakın kaçmasınlar!Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.44,0:19:00.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onları görüyorum!Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.24,0:19:02.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Peşlerinden!Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.25,0:19:12.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Peşlerinden!Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.67,0:19:18.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Albay, peşlerinden gitmeyecek misiniz?Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.55,0:19:22.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gitmeyeceğim, yoruldum.Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.34,0:19:23.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yoruldunuz mu?Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.55,0:19:24.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey...Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.39,0:19:25.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Efendim!Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.10,0:19:28.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Takibi durdurun. Onları yakalamasınlar.Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.85,0:19:35.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Adamları geri çağır. Karargâhla irtibat kur.Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.02,0:19:39.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bölgedeki tüm savaş gemilerini...Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.03,0:19:41.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,derhal Alabasta'ya yollasınlar.Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.45,0:19:43.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Takviye birlik mi...?Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.91,0:19:45.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama efendim,Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.28,0:19:48.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,üstlerimiz birkaç alçak korsanı yakalamak için...Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.32,0:19:50.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bunu yapar mı?Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.50,0:19:53.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üstlerin ne düşündüğü umurumda mı sanıyorsun?!Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.25,0:19:56.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Anlaşıldı efendim! Derhal!Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.17,0:20:01.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Geri dönün! Durun ve geri gelin!Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çabuk!Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.90,0:20:22.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet, bu taraftan. Nami'nin parfümünün kokusu artıyor!Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.74,0:20:27.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alubarna'ya kadar koşarak gitmeyeceğiz, değil mi?!Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.70,0:20:29.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kirpik!Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.83,0:20:32.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kirpik nereye kayboldu?!Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.08,0:20:34.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi aklıma geldi,Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.00,0:20:36.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bu şehirde bir ahır olması lazım!Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.50,0:20:37.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Birkaç at alalım!Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.84,0:20:40.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama Denizciler şehirde!Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.46,0:20:43.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gönlünüzü ferah tutun! İleri bakın.Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.26,0:20:45.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, arkadaşlar!Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.85,0:20:50.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yengeç mi?!Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.02,0:20:51.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.10,0:20:53.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu, taşıyıcı yengeç!Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.35,0:20:55.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lezzetli görünüyor!Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.95,0:21:12.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Müthiş! Müthiş! Müthiş! Süper!Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.75,0:21:14.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Binin!Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.00,0:21:15.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Binebilir miyiz?!Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.75,0:21:18.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tanıştığıma sevindim!Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.92,0:21:21.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yüzü biraz şüpheli görünmüyor mu?Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.25,0:21:23.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yine müthiş bir şey getirmişsin.Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.93,0:21:26.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kirpik'in bir arkadaşı!Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.97,0:21:35.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kirpik bu şehirde doğmuş, bu yüzden her yerde arkadaşı var!Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.14,0:21:37.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama hepsi sapık.Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.73,0:21:42.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Müthiş! Taşıyı yengeçler kendilerini kuma gömerler,Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.32,0:21:44.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bu yüzden nadiren görünürler!Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.24,0:21:47.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Epey hızlı, değil mi?Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.11,0:21:49.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Herkes sıkı tutunsun!Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.91,0:21:52.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ, gidiyoruz! Deh!Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.67,0:22:05.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.42,0:22:08.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dur, Chopper!Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.27,0:22:16.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu o! Ulan!Dialogue: 10,0:22:22.73,0:22:23.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 10,0:22:23.98,0:22:24.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah şu aptal!Dialogue: 10,0:22:25.57,0:22:26.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san!Dialogue: 10,0:22:29.36,0:22:32.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Siz önden gidin! Ben başımın çaresine bakarım!Dialogue: 10,0:22:43.17,0:22:48.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oraya güvenli bir şekilde varın! Vivi'yi evine götürün! Mutlaka!Dialogue: 10,0:22:52.14,0:22:53.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam mı?Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.85,0:22:56.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aptal...Dialogue: 10,0:22:56.98,0:22:57.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.81,0:23:00.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gidelim, Chopper! Doğruca Alubarna'ya!Dialogue: 10,0:23:01.19,0:23:03.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Anlaşıldı.Dialogue: 10,0:23:03.57,0:23:04.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gidelim!Dialogue: 10,0:23:05.94,0:23:07.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,D-Durun biraz!Dialogue: 10,0:23:07.78,0:23:08.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 10,0:23:08.45,0:23:10.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro! Onu bırakacak mıyız?!Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.74,0:23:12.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, bu çok gaddarca!Dialogue: 10,0:23:12.49,0:23:14.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san!Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.24,0:23:17.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorun yok, Vivi! Ona bir şey olmaz!Dialogue: 10,0:23:17.45,0:23:19.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Daha çok diğer ikisi için endişeleniyorum!Dialogue: 10,0:23:19.83,0:23:22.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sonuçta, Luffy birini gözüne kestirdiğinde...Dialogue: 10,0:23:22.83,0:23:26.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,o kişi zarar görmeden kurtulamaz.Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.17,0:23:31.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dinle, Vivi. Crocodile'ı oyalayacak o.Dialogue: 10,0:23:31.64,0:23:34.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İsyan Ordusu harekete geçtiği anda,Dialogue: 10,0:23:34.39,0:23:36.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bu toprakların süresi belirlenmiş oldu.Dialogue: 10,0:23:38.18,0:23:40.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kraliyet Ordusu'yla İsyan Ordusu çarpışırsa,...Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.81,0:23:44.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bu ülkenin,  Alabasta Krallığı'nın işi biter.Dialogue: 10,0:23:44.56,0:23:48.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ve onları durdurmak için tek umut sensen,Dialogue: 10,0:23:49.07,0:23:51.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ne olursa olsun hayatta kalmalısın.Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.11,0:23:57.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şu andan itibaren, herhangi birimize ne olursa olsun, devam etmelisin!Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.16,0:24:01.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Ama...Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.09,0:24:09.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi-chan, bunu sen başlattın.Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.88,0:24:13.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yıllar önce ülkeni terkettin ve hakkında...Dialogue: 10,0:24:13.84,0:24:16.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,hiçbir şey bilmediğin bir örgüte meydan okudun.Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.10,0:24:18.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ancak,Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.06,0:24:22.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,artık tek başına savaşmıyorsun.Dialogue: 10,0:24:26.02,0:24:31.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! V-V-Vivi! E-Endişelenme! Ben... Ben... Ben kesinlikle...Dialogue: 10,0:24:32.99,0:24:37.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san!Dialogue: 10,0:24:34.70,0:24:37.34,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san!Dialogue: 10,0:24:37.34,0:24:37.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hah?Dialogue: 10,0:24:37.91,0:24:40.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni Alubarna'da bekleyeceğiz!!Dialogue: 10,0:24:40.91,0:24:44.48,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,...bekleyeceğiz!!Dialogue: 10,0:24:43.21,0:24:45.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam!Dialogue: 10,0:24:56.26,0:24:59.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Prenses Vivi, bizden kaçtı ha?Dialogue: 10,0:25:00.10,0:25:03.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her hâlükârda, ajanlarımız Alubarna'da toplanacak.Dialogue: 10,0:25:04.48,0:25:06.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hemen onlarla bağlantı kur.Dialogue: 10,0:25:09.07,0:25:13.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şu saçmalığı fazlasıyla abarttın, Hasır Şapkalı Luffy.Dialogue: 10,0:25:17.57,0:25:19.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Biliyorsun o...Dialogue: 10,0:25:19.74,0:25:24.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,güçsüz olmasına rağmen, herkesi kurtarmaya çalışıyor.Dialogue: 10,0:25:26.37,0:25:29.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kimseyi yüzüstü bırakmaya dayanamadığı için acı içinde.Dialogue: 10,0:25:30.30,0:25:33.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu isyanın bile kimse ölmeden sona ermesini istiyor.Dialogue: 10,0:25:33.80,0:25:36.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kimse ölmeden mi?Dialogue: 10,0:25:36.38,0:25:39.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onun gibi duygusal, barışsever aptallar çoktur.Dialogue: 10,0:25:40.76,0:25:43.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onlar gerçek savaşı hiç görmemiş tipler.Dialogue: 10,0:25:43.77,0:25:45.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sence de öyle değil mi?Dialogue: 10,0:25:45.77,0:25:47.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öyle.Dialogue: 10,0:25:50.69,0:25:55.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama sen burada olduğun müddetçe, ölümüne kadar peşinden gelecek.Dialogue: 10,0:25:58.32,0:25:59.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden,...Dialogue: 10,0:25:59.45,0:26:01.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,burada işini bitireceğim!Dialogue: 10,0:26:05.00,0:26:06.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu saçmalığın da ötesinde.Dialogue: 10,0:26:07.21,0:26:11.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,En büyük salak sensin. Resmen örnek teşkil ediyorsun.Dialogue: 10,0:26:11.50,0:26:14.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Birine bağlanırsın, sonra bunun bedelini ödersin.Dialogue: 10,0:26:15.51,0:26:20.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin gibi bir sürü aptala hak ettiklerini verdim.Dialogue: 10,0:26:21.47,0:26:22.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu durumda,Dialogue: 10,0:26:22.93,0:26:25.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,aptal olan sen olmuyor musun?Dialogue: 10,0:26:29.60,0:26:31.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunu komik mi buldun?Dialogue: 10,0:26:32.07,0:26:35.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen de mi ölmek istiyorsun, Nico Robin?Dialogue: 10,0:26:35.86,0:26:38.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İstediğin buysa, hiç durma.Dialogue: 10,0:26:38.11,0:26:41.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca beni o isimle çağırmama sözüne ne oldu?Dialogue: 10,0:26:41.41,0:26:42.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nereye gidiyorsun?Dialogue: 10,0:26:43.08,0:26:45.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alubarna'ya önden gideceğim.Dialogue: 10,0:26:46.25,0:26:48.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şu kadını bir türlü anlayamıyorum.Dialogue: 10,0:26:51.79,0:26:53.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sana üç dakika vereceğim.Dialogue: 10,0:26:57.34,0:26:59.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ondan sonra,Dialogue: 10,0:26:59.51,0:27:02.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,artık seninle oynayacak vaktim olmayacak.Dialogue: 10,0:27:10.60,0:27:12.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şikayetin var mı?Dialogue: 10,0:27:13.36,0:27:15.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayır. Bana uyar.Dialogue: 10,0:27:16.53,0:27:18.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 10,0:27:18.57,0:27:19.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tabanca!Dialogue: 10,0:27:31.46,0:27:32.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oo?Dialogue: 10,0:27:32.58,0:27:34.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 10,0:27:35.04,0:27:36.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damga!Dialogue: 10,0:27:46.89,0:27:50.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni uyarayım, Hasır Şapkalı Luffy.Dialogue: 10,0:27:50.18,0:27:52.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne yaparsan yap,Dialogue: 10,0:27:52.06,0:27:54.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,beni alt edemezsin.Dialogue: 10,0:27:54.86,0:27:58.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik Mitralyöz!Dialogue: 10,0:28:15.34,0:28:17.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dinle, Hasır Şapka Luffy.Dialogue: 10,0:28:17.75,0:28:20.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Değersiz saldırıların sivrisinek ısırığı gibi.Dialogue: 10,0:28:20.34,0:28:22.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Devam etmen anlamsız.Dialogue: 10,0:28:22.30,0:28:23.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beni asla...Dialogue: 10,0:28:23.59,0:28:25.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 10,0:28:25.93,0:28:28.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bazuka!Dialogue: 10,0:28:33.10,0:28:34.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Savaş Baltası!Dialogue: 10,0:28:46.87,0:28:49.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Al bunu, bunu da! Şimdi ezildin mi?!Dialogue: 10,0:28:49.83,0:28:51.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pislik, Kum-croc!Dialogue: 10,0:28:54.87,0:28:57.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sana söyledim, faydasız.Dialogue: 10,0:28:58.29,0:28:59.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lanet olası!Dialogue: 10,0:28:59.55,0:29:03.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar çabaladığın önemli değil, lastik adam.Dialogue: 10,0:29:03.68,0:29:05.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin gibi biri...Dialogue: 10,0:29:07.00,0:29:08.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,beni asla yen–Dialogue: 10,0:29:09.35,0:29:12.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Yen" mi? O ne ki? Seni anlamıyorum!Dialogue: 10,0:29:22.32,0:29:25.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanırım yeterince uzun oynadım.Dialogue: 10,0:29:26.49,0:29:28.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka Luffy.Dialogue: 10,0:29:28.12,0:29:30.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben sürekli ciddi dövüşüyordum!Dialogue: 10,0:29:31.83,0:29:35.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama durum kötü. Ona vuramıyorum bile!Dialogue: 10,0:29:35.96,0:29:37.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sürekli kuma dönüşüyor.Dialogue: 10,0:29:37.75,0:29:41.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen ve ben, aynı sınıf korsan değiliz!Dialogue: 10,0:29:42.51,0:29:44.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çöl Kılıcı!Dialogue: 10,0:29:53.85,0:29:55.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Ah!Dialogue: 10,0:29:55.69,0:29:58.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İyi gördün.Dialogue: 10,0:29:58.02,0:30:01.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sana değseydi, "ah" tan fazlasını söylüyor olurdun.Dialogue: 10,0:30:03.15,0:30:06.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne...?! O şey çölü ikiye böldü!Dialogue: 10,0:30:06.11,0:30:09.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şeytan meyvesi yetenekleri her silahla...Dialogue: 10,0:30:09.53,0:30:13.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,rekabet edebilecek kadar güçlenmelidir.Dialogue: 10,0:30:13.54,0:30:17.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Güçlerini olduğu gibi kabullenip yetinenlerden değilim ben.Dialogue: 10,0:30:18.54,0:30:22.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ve şimdi bana karşı geldiğine pişman olacaksın.Dialogue: 10,0:30:26.38,0:30:28.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çöl Bataklığı!Dialogue: 10,0:30:40.56,0:30:43.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne? Ne? Ne? Ne?!Dialogue: 10,0:30:49.45,0:30:53.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kum! Beni içine çekiyor!Dialogue: 10,0:30:59.37,0:31:02.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kum bataklığını hiç duymadın mı?Dialogue: 10,0:31:02.79,0:31:06.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mezar taşına gerek kalmadan çölde uygun bir mezar yapıyor.Dialogue: 10,0:31:06.84,0:31:10.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kum yer altı suyuna doğru çekilir.Dialogue: 10,0:31:11.30,0:31:14.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onların nerede olduğunu tespit edebiliyorum.Dialogue: 10,0:31:14.81,0:31:19.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dünyadaki hiç kimse çöl dövüşünde bana denk olamaz.Dialogue: 10,0:31:22.15,0:31:23.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kumda canlı canlı...Dialogue: 10,0:31:25.11,0:31:27.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,gömülmeye niyetim yok!Dialogue: 10,0:31:29.78,0:31:31.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni şerefsiz!Dialogue: 10,0:31:31.74,0:31:33.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 10,0:31:33.78,0:31:35.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bazuka!Dialogue: 10,0:31:37.08,0:31:40.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yumruklar işe yaramıyorsa seni yakalayacağım!Dialogue: 10,0:31:40.62,0:31:41.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 10,0:31:41.54,0:31:44.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Parmak Ağı!Dialogue: 10,0:31:46.00,0:31:50.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anlayamıyor musun? Faydasız.Dialogue: 10,0:31:50.72,0:31:52.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 10,0:31:52.01,0:31:54.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kamçı!Dialogue: 10,0:31:56.31,0:31:58.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ aynı şey mi?Dialogue: 10,0:32:00.56,0:32:02.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bırak beni, seni piç!Dialogue: 10,0:32:02.98,0:32:04.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Barkan!Dialogue: 10,0:32:09.32,0:32:10.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kolum!Dialogue: 10,0:32:16.74,0:32:18.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kolum! Kolum!Dialogue: 10,0:32:18.66,0:32:21.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mumyaya dönüştü! Kolum mumyaya dönüştü!Dialogue: 10,0:32:21.87,0:32:23.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kum yüzünden.Dialogue: 10,0:32:23.88,0:32:27.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kolundaki suyu emip çıkardı.Dialogue: 10,0:32:27.92,0:32:32.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Belki de vücudundaki bütün suyu emip seni ölümüne kurutmalıyım.Dialogue: 10,0:32:33.89,0:32:36.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çölün özü işte budur.Dialogue: 10,0:32:38.06,0:32:39.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-Bunun şakası yok!Dialogue: 10,0:32:41.02,0:32:43.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet! Su!Dialogue: 10,0:32:49.86,0:32:51.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Saçma.Dialogue: 10,0:32:51.49,0:32:52.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Saçma falan değil!Dialogue: 10,0:32:52.95,0:32:56.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yuba'daki kuru ihtiyar bütün gece çalışıp...Dialogue: 10,0:32:56.16,0:32:58.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bu suyu benim için çıkardı!Dialogue: 10,0:32:58.99,0:33:00.29,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun,Dialogue: 10,0:33:00.29,0:33:01.91,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,lütfen bunu yanına al.Dialogue: 10,0:33:01.91,0:33:04.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O ihtiyar bana...Dialogue: 10,0:33:06.83,0:33:09.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Yuba asla kumlara teslim olmayacak!" dedi.Dialogue: 10,0:33:09.88,0:33:11.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik.Dialogue: 10,0:33:12.30,0:33:14.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ devam etmekte ısrarcı mısın?Dialogue: 10,0:33:14.34,0:33:16.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Katur Kutur Yeme!Dialogue: 10,0:33:22.10,0:33:24.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Faydasız saçmalıklarından gına geldi!Dialogue: 10,0:33:29.02,0:33:34.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geber. Yuba'nın "Yılmaz" toprağıyla beraber.Dialogue: 10,0:33:35.99,0:33:40.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üç dakikan doldu. Başta dediğim gibi,Dialogue: 10,0:33:40.37,0:33:43.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,seninle daha fazla oynayacak vaktim yok.Dialogue: 10,0:33:44.29,0:33:46.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kum Fırtınası!Dialogue: 10,0:34:02.77,0:34:05.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kum bugün güzel ve kuru.Dialogue: 10,0:34:06.23,0:34:08.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kum fırtınası! Güneyden geliyor!Dialogue: 10,0:34:08.65,0:34:09.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sığınaklara!Dialogue: 10,0:34:09.86,0:34:13.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bekleyin, bu tarafa gelmiyor! Güneye doğru gidiyor!Dialogue: 10,0:34:13.61,0:34:16.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Albay Smoker! O...Dialogue: 10,0:34:21.74,0:34:24.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi! Sorun nedir?Dialogue: 10,0:34:24.00,0:34:26.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rainbase'e giden bir kum fırtınası var!Dialogue: 10,0:34:28.25,0:34:29.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onun işi.Dialogue: 10,0:34:33.09,0:34:34.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 10,0:34:42.35,0:34:44.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dinle, Hasır Şapkalı Luffy.Dialogue: 10,0:34:44.68,0:34:49.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buradaki hakim rüzgârlar hep kuzeyden güneye eser.Dialogue: 10,0:34:49.44,0:34:53.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eğer bu küçük kum fırtınası...Dialogue: 10,0:34:53.32,0:34:56.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,güney rüzgârıyla birleşip olgunlaşırsa,Dialogue: 10,0:34:56.90,0:35:00.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,devasa hâlde nereyi vuracak sanıyorsun?Dialogue: 10,0:35:01.91,0:35:03.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Güneyi mi?Dialogue: 10,0:35:04.70,0:35:05.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yuba'yı.Dialogue: 10,0:35:09.12,0:35:10.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neden?!Dialogue: 10,0:35:11.71,0:35:14.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Ne yapıyorsun?! Kes şunu!Dialogue: 10,0:35:15.67,0:35:18.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bak. Yavaş yavaş güneye gidiyor.Dialogue: 10,0:35:18.97,0:35:21.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kuru ihtiyarın bununla bir alakası yok!Dialogue: 10,0:35:23.05,0:35:26.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lanet olası! Bekle, lanet olası!Dialogue: 10,0:35:27.06,0:35:29.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dur, seni pislik! Dur!Dialogue: 10,0:35:33.06,0:35:35.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vazgeç, işe yaramayacak.Dialogue: 10,0:35:35.90,0:35:38.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu fırtına hızını arttırınca,Dialogue: 10,0:35:38.32,0:35:42.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ben bile durduramayacağım.Dialogue: 10,0:35:42.32,0:35:44.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalga geçmeyi bırak!Dialogue: 10,0:35:45.28,0:35:47.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yuba'nın işi bitti.Dialogue: 10,0:35:47.50,0:35:49.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kes şunu! Hemen! Kes–Dialogue: 10,0:35:59.76,0:36:02.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Benim kim olduğumu sanıyorsun?Dialogue: 10,0:36:07.10,0:36:11.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Konuşmaktan başka bir şey yapmayan bir sürü çaylak var.Dialogue: 10,0:36:11.39,0:36:14.36,Main